>> Animal := Chinthu chatsopano.
>> Factory := Chinthu chatsopano.

Animal chikafika: ['chatsopano'] chitani: {
	>> animal := wekha chatsopano.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal chikafika: ['sound:'] chitani: { :s
	zake sound := s.
}.

Animal chikafika: ['sound'] chitani: { <- zake sound.
}.

>> Dog := Chinthu chatsopano.
>> Cat := Chinthu chatsopano.

Dog chikafika: ['chatsopano'] chitani: { <- Animal chatsopano sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat chikafika: ['chatsopano'] chitani: { <- Animal chatsopano sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Zotuluka lembani: Dog chatsopano sound, mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: Cat chatsopano sound, mzere-watsopano.

Factory chikafika: ['mix:and:'] chitani: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal chatsopano sound: (
		( beast1 sound kuchokera: 0 kutalika: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound kuchokera: 2 kutalika: 5 )
	).
}.

Zotuluka lembani: (Factory mix: Dog chatsopano and: Cat chatsopano) sound, mzere-watsopano.
